      "content": "those work, but can you actually write out a couple of draft versions for me? I want the tone to be sophisticated and academic, but really sharp in how it describes the other side's refusal to see the truth. specifically, i want the prose to make it clear that their ideology isn't just a different opinion, but a kind of cognitive failure that the book is exposing.",
